  "prefLabel": "Plc 1302.15 Licensing bureau",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1302.15 “Licensing bureau” means the organizational unit within the OPLC’s division of licensing and board administration that is responsible for accepting and processing applications.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1300) #13701, eff 8-1-23",
